{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>In my ears.</b> The meaning: 'In my ears, I, YHWH of Hosts—this outrage that was done.' Similar is 'YHWH in a vision to him makes Himself known' (Numbers 12:7). Or it is the prophet's words, and the word 'said' or 'voice' is missing."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:54.719802241Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}